{
  "title": "SKY130 PFET output curves",
  "group": "SKY130 transistors",
  "description": "SKY130 PFET flavors: output curves (Id–Vds, stepped Vgs, 3rd quadrant)",
  "schematic": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "x": 100,
        "y": -133,
        "title": "SKY130 PFET output curves — what this testbench does",
        "lines": [
          "Four PFET flavors (MP1 pfet, MP2 lvt, MP3 hvt, MP4 5v)",
          "share one drain supply VD1 and one gate supply VG1.",
          "VD1 sweeps Vds -1.8 -> 0 V while VG1 steps Vgs through",
          "-1.8 / -1.35 / -0.9 V: curves live in the 3rd quadrant",
          "(both Vds and Id negative for a PMOS).",
          "Each 1-ohm sense resistor RS reads source current as",
          "probes id_01v8, id_lvt, id_hvt, id_5v (= drain Id).",
          "",
          "Set MP1.w_um = 4.0 and re-run to see |id_01v8| roughly",
          "double -- drain current scales with device width."
        ]
      }
    ],
